{"id":"b2353339955c9c49","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path.md","title":"概率一停机不等于逐条随机带停机","display":"ex-geometric-las-vegas-path — 概率一停机不等于逐条随机带停机","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path","aliases":["73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path"],"display":"ex-geometric-las-vegas-path — 概率一停机不等于逐条随机带停机","depends_on":["[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.6–11.4.7, print pp. 509–511; PDF pp. 531–533; local boundary example","source_status":"local-example-and-geometric-series-proof; clarifies textbook halting wording","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-geometric-las-vegas-path — 概率一停机不等于逐条随机带停机"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"49440e374bb38c72\" href=\"?note=49440e374bb38c72\" title=\"73-df-random-acceptance-probability\">73-df-random-acceptance-probability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.6–11.4.7, print pp. 509–511; PDF pp. 531–533; local boundary example"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-example-and-geometric-series-proof; clarifies textbook halting wording"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\mathbf2\\)</span>。在存在的机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_r\">\\(q_r\\)</span> 为拒绝终态；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}\\;[\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}=\\varnothing\\land\n\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}=\\{\\langle1\\rangle^j\\langle0\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land\\Pr_M^r(w)=1\\land\\mathbb E_M(w)=2)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}\\;[\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}=\\varnothing\\land\n\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}=\\{\\langle1\\rangle^j\\langle0\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land\\Pr_M^r(w)=1\\land\\mathbb E_M(w)=2)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该机每步遇到 0 就拒绝，遇到 1 就继续。拒绝前缀权重之和为 Σⱼ2⁻⁽ʲ⁺¹⁾=1，尾概率为 2⁻ᵗ，期望为 2；无限全 1 的随机选择仍给出一条不终止路径。这个路径只有零概率，正是 ZPP 重试论证需要区分的情形。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-acceptance-probability","status":"resolved","id":"49440e374bb38c72","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"q_r","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}\\;[\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;(\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}=\\varnothing\\land\n\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}=\\{\\langle1\\rangle^j\\langle0\\rangle:j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land\\Pr_M^r(w)=1\\land\\mathbb E_M(w)=2)].","display":true}],"bytes":1475,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-geometric-las-vegas-path|概率一停机不等于逐条随机带停机]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["49440e374bb38c72"]}